---
// Comparison Table - 终端风格对比矩阵
---

<section class="relative py-20 bg-[#0A0A0A]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20 flex flex-col items-center">
    <span class="block text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-[2px] text-accent mb-6">HOW WE COMPARE</span>
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white mb-10 text-center">AgentPuter vs. Everything Else</h2>
    
    <!-- 终端对比矩阵 -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-[1000px] rounded-xl border border-[#00FF4130] overflow-hidden bg-[#0D1117]">
      <!-- 终端头部 -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 h-9 bg-[#252525]">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#EF4444]"></span>
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#F59E0B]"></span>
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#22C55E]"></span>
        <span class="ml-2 text-[#64748B] font-mono text-[11px]">agentputer — comparison matrix</span>
      </div>
      
      <!-- 终端内容 -->
      <div class="p-5 overflow-x-auto">
        <pre class="font-mono text-xs md:text-[13px] leading-relaxed"><span class="text-[#00BFFF]">$ agentputer compare --all</span>

<span class="text-accent">                  Computer   MCP /                          Agent-</span>
<span class="text-accent">  Dimension       Use        Plugins   Claude    OpenClaw   Puter</span>
<span class="text-[#333333]">  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  Persistence     None       Limited   Limited   Local      <span class="text-accent">✓ Full</span></span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  24/7 uptime     No         No        No        Manual     <span class="text-accent">✓ Auto</span></span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  Auth mgmt       None       Vendor    Vendor    Manual     <span class="text-accent">✓ Auto</span></span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  Multi-agent     No         No        No        No         <span class="text-accent">✓ Yes</span></span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  Remote access   Cloud      Cloud     Cloud     No         <span class="text-accent">✓ Yes</span></span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  Audit trail     Partial    None      None      Partial    <span class="text-accent">✓ Full</span></span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  Cost control    None       None      None      None       <span class="text-accent">✓ Yes</span></span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  Injection def.  None       None      None      None       <span class="text-accent">✓ Proxy</span></span>

<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  Privacy         Cloud      Cloud     Cloud     <span class="text-accent">✓ Local</span>    <span class="text-accent">✓ Local</span></span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  User barrier    Low        Medium    Low       High       <span class="text-accent">✓ Low</span></span>

<span class="text-accent font-bold">  Result: AgentPuter ████████████████████ 10/10 ✓</span></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
